      <section class="vaidyam-legacy" id="legacy" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
        <div class="page-width vaidyam-container">
          <h2 class="vaidyam-section-title">Our Legacy</h2>
          <div class="vaidyam-legacy__content">
            <p>Kerala Ayurveda Vaidyam stands as a pioneering voice in Ayurveda—honouring tradition while advancing contemporary understanding. Founded on the vision of our patron, Dr. K. Anilkumar, and nurtured by the scholarly rigour of Prof. C. R. Agniveś and Dr. K. Rajagopalan, the magazine was conceived as a trusted forum where classical ayurvedic wisdom could meet present-day scientific inquiry. Their groundwork established Vaidyam as a credible, practitioner-focused platform committed to clarity, integrity, and impact.</p>
            <p>Ever since its inception, Vaidyam continues to evolve with purpose. We work on careful interpretation of the classics, encourage critical dialogue, and publish refined insights that help readers translate theory into practice. What began as a commitment to preserve knowledge has become a living legacy of dissemination and discovery.</p>
            
            <div class="vaidyam-legacy__pillars">
              <div class="vaidyam-legacy__pillar">
                <div class="vaidyam-pillar-badge">01</div>
                <strong>Impart Clinical Skills</strong>
                <span>Igniting the inquiring minds of Ayurveda students and doctors through deep clinical casuistry.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="vaidyam-legacy__pillar">
                <div class="vaidyam-pillar-badge">02</div>
                <strong>Contextualise Research</strong>
                <span>Framing contemporary scientific and clinical trials squarely within classical Ayurvedic principles.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="vaidyam-legacy__pillar">
                <div class="vaidyam-pillar-badge">03</div>
                <strong>Support Ethical Care</strong>
                <span>Fostering patient-centred, evidence-informed practices for lasting global wellness.</span>
              </div>
